# Only send inputs required by Dockerfile. Build the workbench first.
**
!Dockerfile
!.dockerignore
!pyproject.toml
!README.md
!uv.lock
!src/
!src/**
!support/
!support/**
!artifacts/
artifacts/*
!artifacts/workbench-dist/
!artifacts/workbench-dist/**

# Exclude incidental files even within included source/data directories.
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/.DS_Store
**/._*
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
